From: ikloog <ikloog@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:27:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Closing the window can pause what plays

Settings > Playback > Pause the music when Melody closes: off by default.
On, closing the window pauses what plays on every engine it is connected
to -- this computer's or a server's -- with playback.pause, sent as it
closes; each connection finishes its commands before it goes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
